/**
 * "Enterprise-grade security for your invoice data" — Figma node 18270:58163
 * ("Fold 5? .Container - How Cleartax helps"). The tabbed
 * compliance / integrations / security / support block, copied from
 * `spain-regional/Seamless.astro` (a page's CSS entry only sources its own
 * section folder). Only the heading differs from Spain's; tabs, cards and
 * behaviour are identical.
 *
 * Originally ported from global-e-invoicing-mandate-page/index.html:3076-3467.
 *
 * Desktop (lg+): original two-column layout — a vertical accordion-style list
 * of tab headers on the left (each reveals a one-line description when
 * active), a single shared visual pane on the right that the script swaps
 * between `[data-ssr-graphic]` panels.
 *
 * Mobile (<lg): a horizontal, scrollable tab bar up top; tapping a tab swaps
 * a single panel below it that holds that tab's description AND its visual
 * (cards / logo grid / icon grid / image) together — a plain tab switcher,
 * not an accordion. Separate markup and a separate, independent script from
 * the desktop block; the two never interact.
 */

